%% HakiArdhi - Incident Reporting Flow
%% This flowchart shows the complete citizen journey for reporting incidents

graph TD
    Start([Citizen Reports Incident]) --> A[Citizen sends WhatsApp message:<br/>'Kuna matatizo kwenye ardhi yangu']
    A --> B[AI identifies intent:<br/>Incident Reporting]
    B --> C[Bot asks: What type of incident?<br/>Shows interactive buttons]
    C --> D{Select Incident Type}

    D -->|Land Encroachment| E[Collect Details]
    D -->|Property Damage| E
    D -->|Dispute| E
    D -->|Theft| E
    D -->|Other| E

    E --> F[Citizen provides:<br/>• Description<br/>• Location<br/>• Photos/Evidence]

    F --> G[TIER 1: AUTOMATED VALIDATION]
    G --> H{Validation Checks}
    H --> I[✓ Phone number verified]
    H --> J[✓ Location coordinates valid]
    H --> K[✓ No duplicate reports]
    H --> L[✓ Photo metadata checked]

    I --> M{Pass Tier 1?}
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M

    M -->|No| N[FLAGGED FOR REVIEW]
    M -->|Yes| O[TIER 2: VILLAGE LEADER VALIDATION]

    O --> P[Village leader receives notification:<br/>'Please verify this incident']
    P --> Q[Leader reviews and responds:<br/>• Confirms incident is real<br/>• Knows the person<br/>• Location is accurate]

    Q --> R[Credibility Score Calculated<br/>0-100 scale]

    R --> S{Score > 60?}
    S -->|No| T[REJECTED<br/>Citizen notified]
    S -->|Yes| U[TIER 3: FIELD OFFICER VERIFICATION]

    U --> V[• Officer assigned by location<br/>• Field visit scheduled<br/>• Physical verification<br/>• Evidence collected]

    V --> W[Case Created & Tracked<br/>Case #: HAK-INC-2025-XXXX]

    W --> X[Citizen receives:<br/>• Case number<br/>• Status updates via WhatsApp]

    X --> End([Case Tracking Begins])

    style Start fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style G fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1565C0,color:#fff
    style O fill:#FF9800,stroke:#E65100,color:#fff
    style U fill:#9C27B0,stroke:#6A1B9A,color:#fff
    style End fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style N fill:#f44336,stroke:#c62828,color:#fff
    style T fill:#f44336,stroke:#c62828,color:#fff
